WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.892
The module goes deeply into the pieces that directly affect practical L L M applications: weights and hidden states,

00:00:07.892 --> 00:00:17.382
decoder generation, prompting, structured output, model access, memory, quantization, local inference, evaluation, RAG,

00:00:17.382 --> 00:00:21.382
and tool calling. Some neighboring subjects are introduced only briefly.

00:00:21.382 --> 00:00:28.582
Full fine-tuning, distributed training, benchmark design, large-scale training optimization,

00:00:28.582 --> 00:00:32.732
and production serving deserve their own deeper treatment.

00:00:32.732 --> 00:00:36.197
The boundary is deliberate.

00:00:36.197 --> 00:00:44.539
You should leave knowing what you can build now and what topics would require a more specialized course.
